<title>USA: FSA qualifies three issues for bond insurance.</title>
<headline>FSA qualifies three issues for bond insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Security Assurance said it has qualified for bond insurance the following three municipal issues scheduled for competitive sale today.</p>
<p>--Deforest Area School District, Wis., $5.8 million general obligation building bonds.</p>
<p>--Janesville, Wis., $9.750 million promissory GOs.</p>
<p>--Franklin Twp., $1.9 million GOs.</p>
<p>((--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650))</p>
</text>
